// Greatest winning labeled hamming strictly above the smallest kept hamming.
// One hamming returns nothing. A greater hamming returns that hamming.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE hhigh ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG hhigh rank

IMPULSE hhigh 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "hhigh" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
